                            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-electric-400"></i> Kanban Individual + Kanban Geral</li>
                            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-electric-400"></i> Financeiro completo por barbeiro</li>
